We are now going after that and we're going to finish it and then just checking up on your suggestions

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:07.030
and of course whatever happens in the chess world

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:10.129
So thank you all I will see you soon and have an excellent rest of your day!

